+---
+title: 'GH-32: deterministic BMAD setup failures must not offer futile retry'
+type: 'bugfix'
+created: '2026-09-30'
+status: 'in-review'
+route: 'oneshot'
+baseline_commit: '2aa836abe262759c651683deb40d05f02c9ede86'
